---
title: Spicy five spice potatoes
servings: 4
tags: [chinese, vegan, gluten-free, quick]
cuisine: chinese
time: 14 minutes
source: Five spice potatoes by Red House Spice, https://redhousespice.com/five-spice-potatoes
nutrition:
  calories: 233 kcal
---

Put the @potatoes{900%g}(baby) in a #pot{} with just enough cold @water{} to cover.

Bring to a full boil, then simmer over low heat until just cooked, about ~{5%minutes}. A fork should go in with a little resistance; do not let them go soft. Drain.

Heat the @cooking oil{2%tbsp} in a large #frying pan{} and add the potatoes. Press each one with a glass until it cracks, without mashing it.

Fry over medium heat until golden underneath, then turn and brown the other side.

Mix the @chili flakes{1/2%tbsp}, @five spice powder{1/4%tsp} and @salt{1/4%tsp} and sprinkle over.

Scatter with the @scallions{1}(finely chopped) and serve at once.
